			"Message": "style(Cocoon): Normalize whitespace and line-break patterns across handlers\n\nCollapse over-wrapped multiline expressions into compact single-line forms where readability is preserved (Extension Host activation stack trimming, Request Routing getChildren call). Reflow the WorkspaceBridge AcceptWorkspaceData call in Notification/Handler to unwrap outer parentheses against the optional-chaining chain for consistent structure. Insert blank-line separators between switch-case bodies in Configuration.ts and between accessor declarations in Notification/Handler for clearer visual grouping.\n\nZero logical changes – formatting only.",
