			"Message": "docs(Cocoon): Expand README with GitHub badge table and reformat prose\n\nRestore an HTML badges table to the README header showing repository\nmetrics (stars, downloads, issues, last-commit), and restructure the\nFunding section with an HTML table for aligned Land/PlayForm/NLnet/NGI0\nlogo attribution. Hard-wrap all prose at ~80 columns for consistent\nterminal readability.\n\nAlongside the documentation refresh, collapse over-wrapped type annotations\nin CommandService and WebviewPanel/State, expand inter-property spacing in\nProto/vine.d.ts for consistent declaration formatting, and reformat the\nParseUri regex in WorkspaceService. Regenerate the RouteManifest timestamp\nto 2026-06-12T02:15:20Z.\n\nNo functional changes — documentation and style only.",
