			"Message": "docs(Cocoon): Streamline and modernize README\n\nCondense the Cocoon README from a verbose HTML-heavy document into a concise, scannable reference. Remove the oversized HTML header table, the two-page \"Deep Dive\" walkthrough, and the bloated component matrix — replace with tight markdown tables and a focused architecture section. Collapse the interaction flow into a brief numbered list, simplify the Funding block from an HTML table to inline markdown images, and drop redundant emoji spacing patterns throughout.\n\nResult: ~210 lines of formatted content reduced to ~29 lines of meaningful documentation while preserving all key architectural detail, component links, and dependency tables.",
